# Desktop launcher

Cold start opens the **launcher window only** (same Electron process). Do not call `dsh web` until after `checkUpdate()`. Newer formal GitHub release → ask; skip or no update → start desktop unless dest `sessions/` is empty and `~/.dsh` has importable data. Close launcher only when desktop ready + `quitAfterStart` + healthy full start (`lastStart.ok===true`, not sticky skip, not recovery launch). Start / plugin-tree failure → keep launcher and show home **Recovery Board** (full plugin list, attribution, per-plugin toggle, batch disable suspects). Clearing sticky skip on「启动桌面端」forces restart; forensics disable/enable aligns via `startHarness` (not `startDesktop`). Batch disable via `shell:disable-plugins`. `HarnessController.restart()` awaits any in-flight restart then always starts a fresh `replaceOperation`. Skip-user-plugins recovery must not ensure market/usage/dshbot (standalone plugin; `removeDshbotPreset` cleanup only); desktop-install still required.

Launcher uses official `--dsw-alias-*` and the official light/dark tables (`data-ds-dark-theme`). Do not paint Appearance wallpaper seeds onto the launcher. `--boot-*` stays on the main-window boot canvas. Marketplace / wallpaper gallery still must not open extra product windows.

Versions are desktop Setup.exe from non-draft GitHub Releases, not a `vendor/dsh` pin switch. Keep 0.2.7 a GitHub **draft** until this launcher ships in the installer (`/releases/latest` must not push 0.2.6 users onto a build without the launcher).

